# Cloudflare Pages _redirects — FIRST MATCH WINS, top to bottom.
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# THE RULE THIS FILE EXISTS TO ENFORCE
#
# No pattern here may match one of the ten canonical routes in
# src/config/routes.js. A pattern that matches its own destination is an
# infinite redirect, and Pages applies redirects before serving the static
# asset, so the page becomes unreachable rather than merely slow.
#
# Four trailing globs did exactly that and took three pages off the site:
#
#   /sellers*  ->  /sellers/    "/sellers/" matches "/sellers*"
#   /sell*     ->  /sellers/    "/sellers/" is "/sell" + "ers/"
#   /buy*      ->  /buyers/     "/buyers/"  is "/buy"  + "ers/"
#   /areas/*   ->  /areas/      the splat also matches the empty string
#
# /buyers/, /sellers/ and /areas/ — all three in the top nav, and the
# targets of both homepage CTAs — 301'd to themselves until 14 Sep 2026.
#
# Retirement rules are now anchored one segment DEEPER than the surviving
# route (/areas/zip/*, /buyers/first-time/*, /sell/*, /buy/*), or name a
# prefix no canonical route shares (/tools/, /blog/, /compare/, /lp/), or
# are exact paths. `npm run check:routes` proves it: it serves the site
# with `wrangler pages dev` and fails on a non-200 or a chain over one hop.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Canonical host: www -> apex.
https://www.tdrealtyohio.com/* https://tdrealtyohio.com/:splat 301

# ── Trailing slash. Exact paths only; a glob here is what caused the loop.
/about                  /about/                 301
/agents                 /agents/                301
/areas                  /areas/                 301
/buyers                 /buyers/                301
/contact                /contact/               301
/fair-housing           /fair-housing/          301
/privacy                /privacy/               301
/sellers                /sellers/               301
/terms                  /terms/                 301

# ── Legacy .html paths.
/index.html             /                       301
/about.html             /about/                 301
/agents.html            /agents/                301
/buyers.html            /buyers/                301
/contact.html           /contact/               301
/fair-housing.html      /fair-housing/          301
/privacy.html           /privacy/               301
/sellers.html           /sellers/               301
/terms.html             /terms/                 301

# ── Retired page families.
# Each is anchored deeper than the route it points at, or shares no prefix
# with any canonical route, so none of them can match a live page.
/areas/zip/*            /areas/                 301
/buyers/first-time/*    /buyers/                301
/sell/*                 /sellers/               301
/buy/*                  /buyers/                301
/tools/*                /contact/               301
/blog/*                 /about/                 301
/compare/*              /sellers/               301
/lp/*                   /                       301

